[[Strife Unending]] is a non-unique [[WvW]] [[legendary trinket]].

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|Prey! Prey in herds, in waves! Running and bellowing, flinging stones and beating the gates. But we are many, and they are prey. Soon, the game! We are waiting well for the loudest voice. For chasing, scaring, pouncing, killing! The game!}}

